        {
          "text": " Yaahanika omugabe wa Ai aha muti okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; kandi eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, Yoshua yaaragiira, baahanura omutumbi gwe, baagunaga omu maisho g'eirembo ry'orurembo, baagurundaho omutuumo muhango gw'amabaare, ogukiriho n'okuhitsya eri izooba.",
          "type": "text",
